    {
      "id": "p0259-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A secret monster named Mad Mew Mew appears in the Nintendo Switch version of Undertale. Mad Mew Mew is a catgirl doll possessed by the spirit of a revengeful enemy named Mad Dummy. During the game's ending credits, Mad Mew Mew's name is accompanied by the phrase:",
